[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817222082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105587#issuecomment-2817222082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105587","id":2817222082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n62XC","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T15:26:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T15:29:11Z","body":"If anybody wants to test it, you can build Weston with this patch:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/libweston/input.c b/libweston/input.c\r\nindex e4c51a6a..e26abe75 100644\r\n--- a/libweston/input.c\r\n+++ b/libweston/input.c\r\n@@ -4336,7 +4336,7 @@ weston_seat_init(struct weston_seat *seat, struct weston_compositor *ec,\r\n \twl_signal_init(&seat->tablet_tool_added_signal);\r\n \r\n \tseat->global = wl_global_create(ec->wl_display, &wl_seat_interface,\r\n-\t\t\t\t\tMIN(wl_seat_interface.version, 7),\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t4,\r\n \t\t\t\t\tseat, bind_seat);\r\n \r\n \tseat->compositor = ec;\r\n```\r\n\r\nI personally did so and it seems to work well, I don't think this needs any particular testing. I'm writing this here mostly for documentation purposes since no current compositor seems to expose such a version.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817222082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833707623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105587#issuecomment-2833707623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105587","id":2833707623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o5vJn","user":{"login":"Anutrix","id":11459028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU5MDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11459028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix","html_url":"https://github.com/Anutrix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T00:02:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T00:02:14Z","body":"Just curious but `wl_pointer_get_version(wl_pointer) < WL_POINTER_FRAME_SINCE_VERSION` can be moved to somewhere it runs once, right? Not needed on every call. Or does compiler optimize it by understanding version doesn't change during runtime?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833707623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833727615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105587#issuecomment-2833727615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105587","id":2833727615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o50B_","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T00:29:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T00:29:09Z","body":"Hi @Anutrix! I don't think there's a way around.\r\n\r\n> Or does compiler optimize it by understanding version doesn't change during runtime?\r\n\r\nIt can change, `wl_pointer_get_version` is not constant. We try to support as many compositors as possible, which means that we have absolutely no idea what `wl_seat` version is going to be available.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833727615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3376465658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105587#issuecomment-3376465658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105587","id":3376465658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JQMb6","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T11:27:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T11:27:09Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3376465658/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3379055880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105587#issuecomment-3379055880","issue_url":"https://api.github.